%% alt: The four levels as a ladder, each one keeping everything below it. Nominal: same or different, so count and mode. Ordinal adds order, so median, minimum, maximum and rank. Interval adds equal gaps, so mean, standard deviation and differences. Ratio adds a true zero, so ratios and totals.
flowchart TD
  N["Nominal<br/>same or different<br/>count, mode"]
  O["Ordinal<br/>adds order<br/>median, min, max, rank"]
  I["Interval<br/>adds equal gaps<br/>mean, spread, differences"]
  R["Ratio<br/>adds a true zero<br/>ratios, totals"]
  N -- "+ order" --> O
  O -- "+ equal gaps" --> I
  I -- "+ true zero" --> R
